	(descr "XKB SS22E01L5 DPDT slide switch (LCSC C609835), RS-485 termination. Footprint from easyeda2kicad (LCSC/EasyEDA data) 2026-07-25. 6 signal pads 2.5mm col / 2.5mm row + 2 mounting-tab posts numbered 7/8 per the EasyEDA/vendor drawing (tie to GND). Pin numbering 1-2-3 / 4-5-6 with centers 2/5 = pole commons, matching the EG2201A symbol -- drop-in for SW3 (keep the EG2201A symbol, change only the footprint). *** VERIFY against the SS22E01L5 datasheet that pin 2 = pole-A common / pin 1 = the throw that pairs with pin 4 (both = 'terminated' position), so terminate + TERM_SENSE track together. ***")
	(tags "switch slide DPDT SS22E01L5 RS-485 termination")
